{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_985.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"f341a6161551047cc8f15c0cc8ee13531ed3623c1c8c00d7b4f9952774b89158","ja":"活動的なお正月","zh":"活力十足的新年","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_985.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"3728ae609525938dbedad6c3121d37bcc087359336cbfc7ae6b64faa34f394d6","ja":"というわけで、運動しようよ！\n一年の計は元旦にありって言うし！","zh":"所以说，来运动吧！\n俗话说，一年之计在于春嘛！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_985.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"0b7589d2b675645357f95dcc46a38f4940d24c0462bf3857615f9eba9302030b","ja":"さっきお仕事で走ったばかりじゃ……まあ、いいけど。\nそれで何するの？","zh":"刚才不是才为了工作跑过吗……不过，行吧。那要做什么？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_985.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"a9620b6527e7d7dd436c4293da086572f457cae8d0178087b8ff5fb2248a90fb","ja":"お正月らしく、全力疾走凧あげとか！","zh":"要不要来点符合新年气氛的全力奔跑放风筝之类的！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_985.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"3cf86b28ff21c4c2c12a7cdb4c82f7c7fb088d05e138a353e8ea315d475038c9","ja":"そんなの聞いたことないけど……。\nそれに凧ないよ？","zh":"我可没听说过这种事……。\n而且也没有风筝呀？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_985.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"335ebd1d73969e7bf7dd042a838ecfb9bf9305e6cd507a9afcb02f4f5252f116","ja":"それじゃあ……羽根つきなんてどう？\n大掃除のとき、羽子板みつけたんだー。","zh":"那就……玩羽毛毽怎么样？\n大扫除的时候，我找到了羽子板哦。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_985.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"8625b278e9a75797b681a223266858cfb60c0857b22fc916201584c8a1dee624","ja":"羽子板か～。それなら\nお正月っぽいし気軽にやれそうだね。","zh":"羽子板啊～那样的话，很有过新年气氛，而且感觉可以轻松玩玩呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_985.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"0816617fe6d591373b1495751e52a461d491ba3fbe81f146eeec50737b29ae6e","ja":"決まりだね！\nミキミキはどうする？","zh":"就这么决定啦！\n美希美希打算怎么办？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_985.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"378c681bbcb949d28c007a082a728084f8899bd5d7af13ae51a49537154511e0","ja":"……む～？　羽根つき～？\nミキは一眠りしてからにするの～……あふぅ。","zh":"……嗯～？要玩羽毛毽子～？\n美希要睡一觉之后再玩～……哈呜。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_985.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"307dc02d4b791586250f68c066b83f9d84bbdb0953a8d9eebb4e00be9507a698","ja":"わかった！　ず～っとやってるから\nいつでも来てね！　行こ、ももちん♪","zh":"知道啦！我会一直做下去的，所以随时都来哦！走吧，桃子♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_985.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"68dcd67a229e733330e6a0c49625f4ccde536ce8e3c24d19f93f5fde6eea4ff2","ja":"うん。でも、ず～っとはやらないからね。","zh":"嗯。不过，我不会一直玩下去哦。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_985.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"9d47808db37019fab28eb457d76e804b8a355af0e839349ccc5ffb7afb3e95d2","ja":"……って、聞いてるの！？\nちょっと海美さん！","zh":"……等等，你有在听吗！？\n喂，海美小姐！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_985.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"006ce0f78613816732303059026c316bfb2d3c038343c2cac2f9382f49e69a45","ja":"あふぅ……。","zh":"哈啊……。","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
