{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_985.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"31b70bf61008804cecc9d9917e7fb22930057fccdd684b31ceb146abb088ad8d","ja":"ぐっすり眠れたの～☆\n……あれ？　誰か、帰ってきたのかな～？　あっ！！","zh":"睡得好香啊～☆\n……咦？有人回来了吗～？啊！！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
